{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17084","headline":"奉酬宣上人九月十五日东亭望月见赠因怀紫阁旧游 · 郑絪","name":"奉酬宣上人九月十五日东亭望月见赠因怀紫阁旧游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中年偶逐鸳鸾侣，弱岁多从麋鹿羣。\n紫阁道流今不见，红楼禅客早曾闻。\n松斋月朗星初散，苔砌霜繁夜欲分。\n一览彩牋佳句满，何人更咏惠休文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑絪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}